variable_impedance_controllers

This package is a modified version of crisp_controllers
  https://github.com/learnsyslab/crisp_controllers
  release 2.4.1, commit ccbead4ba22b1a5b43ac8e81d7137c9ed7b65925
  Copyright (c) 2026 Learning Systems and Robotics Lab, Technical University of Munich
  MIT License -- see LICENSE.md, which applies to this whole package.

Changes from the original:
  * Renamed the package, C++ namespace, include directory, plugin library and
    plugin class names from crisp_controllers to variable_impedance_controllers,
    so both can be installed side by side.
  * Added include/variable_impedance_controllers/utils/log_space_stiffness_rate_limiter.hpp
    and utils/energy_tank.hpp, with tests/test_log_space_stiffness_rate_limiter.cpp
    and tests/test_energy_tank.cpp.
  * Modified CartesianController (include/.../cartesian_controller.hpp,
    src/cartesian_controller.cpp, src/cartesian_controller.yaml) to run the target
    stiffness through both every control cycle, with a new stiffness_shaping
    parameter block and ~/diagnostics topics.
  * Removed the documentation website, media, pixi/Python tooling and CI
    workflows; rewrote README.md.
